        "accordion_block_3_0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer warranty for your products?",
            "text": "<p>We stand behind the craftsmanship of each one of our products. <br/><br/>That’s why we offer a <strong>1-year warranty</strong> that covers manufacturing and workmanship defects outside of normal wear and tear. For full coverage and exclusions see below. <br/><br/>We take pride in our product so if you notice anything out of the ordinary, please submit a claim by emailing us at support@laylopets.com. We review messages daily and will get back to you within 24 hours. <br/><br/>This Limited Warranty excludes: (a) minor imperfections and slight cosmetic flaws; (b) normal wear and tear associated with intended use and washing; (c) stains, soiling, burns, dampness, wetness, mold or discoloration that occur over time; (d) individual or personalized allergies and sensitivities; (e) color variations; (f) changes in personal comfort preferences; (g) damage or abuse caused by failure reasonably to use and care for the Product; (h) commercial use; or (i) chewing and destructive activity not related to paws digging on fabric; (j) any combination of defects resulting from the aforementioned.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_block_3_2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I submit a claim?",
            "text": "<p>If you have any issues within the warranty period, please reach out to support@laylopets.com with your order number and a photo of the issue. If the defect is covered by our warranty, we'll make it right.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
